msgid "Debug Output"
msgstr "调试输出"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:18 2e8776959bf14975b245e590c7fdfc20
msgid ""
"There are three ways to easily get debug output from your code - so called "
"\"printf debugging\"."
msgstr "从代码中获取调试输出有三种简便方法，即所谓的「printf 调试」。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:21 8b301cc2b16d434992ae7402dd4000c5
msgid "MAVLink messages"
msgstr "MAVLink 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:23 42f77912c6714913be25ed96d33ef863
msgid ""
"These messages will appear on Ground Control Stations (and will also appear "
"in onboard log logs)."
msgstr "这些消息将显示在地面控制站上（也会出现在机载日志中）。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:25 5d6d281239944eb8a6e78ffae4bc05f1
msgid ""
"Most places in the code you can insert a single statement to send a text "
"message to the GCS, using the GCS singleton:"
msgstr "在代码的大多数位置，可以使用 GCS 单例插入单条语句向地面控制站发送文本消息："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:33 2b17aa9499024f9b9357a03bcecec2c0
msgid "Onboard Log messages"
msgstr "机载日志消息"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:35 7dfdedf5e3564912ab8707a06a42a69f
msgid ""
"The AP_Logger singleton can be used to put messages to the onboard log:"
msgstr "可以使用 AP_Logger 单例向机载日志写入消息："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:44 e0b25cfbe3dd4868b59bb437b4b167c7
msgid ""
"More complicated messages (with multiple fields of differing types) can be "
"created with Log_Write:"
msgstr "更复杂的消息（包含多个不同类型的字段）可以通过 Log_Write 创建："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:56 dac6ef41f05c4cf7b1713bd65b1eca69
msgid ""
"See AP_Logger.h for the definition of this method.  Generally, it's a "
"4-character name followed by a comma-separated list of column names, "
"followed by a list of list of format specifiers for each column, followed by"
" the data.  Similar definitions allow addition of multiplier and unit "
"information."
msgstr ""
"参见 AP_Logger.h 中该方法的定义。通常格式为：4 "
"字符名称，后跟逗号分隔的列名列表，再跟每列的格式说明符列表，最后是数据。类似的定义还允许添加倍率和单位信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:59 f135665b0d94416f810da7984b92bfc3
msgid "printf(...) and friends"
msgstr "printf(...) 及相关函数"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:61 de898417d24646c4a86171b39bbc9ffb
msgid "Everybody's favourite go-to debugging tool."
msgstr "大家最常用的调试工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:63 db5cb66aa71e4347a90c08b78a4bb90e
msgid ""
"Availability and where the output of this command goes is dependent on which"
" hardware you are running on."
msgstr "该命令是否可用以及输出位置取决于所运行的硬件平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:65 14a3bd42a8524d439ef5a4c269d378fb
msgid ""
"In SITL you can see stderr and stdout output in the xterm Window running the"
" ArduPilot binary - or, on Windows, in the log file created in place of that"
" window."
msgstr ""
"在 SITL 中，可以在运行 ArduPilot 二进制文件的 xterm 窗口中查看 stderr 和 stdout 输出；在 Windows "
"上则可在替代该窗口所创建的日志文件中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:67 3fb87d5b134346a6b5a9df99e50bc56e
msgid ""
"On Linux this output will appear on ArduPilot's controlling TTY - so in "
"whatever terminal you started ArduPilot in."
msgstr "在 Linux 上，输出将显示在 ArduPilot 的控制终端（TTY）上，即启动 ArduPilot 时所用的终端。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:69 6998db56305a43eba913cea1534048c0
msgid ""
"The stderr and stdout file handles are not available on ChibiOS, so fprintf "
"is not an option.  However, printf(...) output is either sent to a specified"
" serial device (see \"STDOUT_SERIAL\" in hwdef.dat), or to the console (the "
"first-defined SERIAL device)."
msgstr ""
"ChibiOS 不支持 stderr 和 stdout 文件句柄，因此 fprintf 不可用。但 printf(...) "
"的输出会被发送到指定的串口设备（参见 hwdef.dat 中的「STDOUT_SERIAL」），或发送到控制台（第一个定义的 SERIAL 设备）。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:73 011cf5fb05124deba05511fe7076c70e
msgid "hal.console->printf(...);"
msgstr "hal.console->printf(...);"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:76 9f030596a5c6409bae309a571135569a
msgid ""
"This output appears on the console.  For ChibiOS-based boards this is the "
"first-defined SERIAL device."
msgstr "此输出显示在控制台上。对于基于 ChibiOS 的板卡，这是第一个定义的 SERIAL 设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:79 53060866536c48dea31c910cd3187462
msgid "Catching memory overruns"
msgstr "捕获内存越界"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:81 5510e89e560f47069fdbafc397841ec0
msgid ""
"You can place guard regions around memory areas in the code to catch "
"overruns by configuring the build using the ----enable-malloc-guard option "
"on \"waf configure\" command prior to building the code for SITL"
msgstr ""
"在为 SITL 构建代码之前，可在「waf configure」命令中使用 ----enable-malloc-guard "
"选项，在代码的内存区域周围设置保护区以捕获越界访问"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:84 6d69b5e4b48a454f8f5a789a3d090437
msgid "GPIO Assert Debugging"
msgstr "GPIO 断言调试"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:86 d4842bf717b34ddd839b039bd0363051
msgid ""
"It is possible to output debug assertions from ChibiOS (so the debug errors "
"that you get if you build with --enable-asserts) using a GPIO pin. To do "
"this you need to set \"FAULT\" in hwdef.dat to the GPIO pin you want to use "
"and then connect a logic analyzer to the pin. You will also need to "
"configure your logic analyzer to interpret the serial stream and print "
"readable information but most modern logic analyzers are able to do this "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 GPIO 引脚输出 ChibiOS 的调试断言（即使用 --enable-asserts 构建时获得的调试错误）。为此需要在 "
"hwdef.dat 中将「FAULT」设置为目标 GPIO "
"引脚，然后将逻辑分析仪连接到该引脚。还需要配置逻辑分析仪以解析串行流并打印可读信息，但大多数现代逻辑分析仪可自动完成此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging.rst:88 2853fc2f51ce49cdbdca87abf3821992
msgid ""
"You can also use this pin defintion to output general debug messages using "
"fault_printf(). This works in exactly the same way as printf() but outputs "
"to the GPIO pin. Both of these methods are extremely useful for debugging "
"situations where general IO is not available."
msgstr ""
"还可以使用此引脚定义通过 fault_printf() 输出通用调试消息。其工作方式与 printf() 完全相同，但输出到 GPIO "
"引脚。这两种方法在通用 IO 不可用的调试场景中极为有用。"
